%% Sarah AI: inbound voice path.
flowchart LR
    C[Caller] --> T[Telephony provider]
    T -->|SIP bridge| RT[[Realtime speech model]]
    RT -->|verified webhook: call.incoming| App[App server]
    App -->|session config: AI disclosure first| RT
    RT -->|tool calls| Reg[Shared tool registry - same as SMS]
    Reg --> DB[(Schedule DB)]
    Reg --> PI[Pending intents]
    RT -->|caller asks for a human| WT[Warm transfer: hold loop, attempt window, scripted outcomes]
    WT --> Staff[Staff workstation]
    WT -->|no answer| CB[Truthful fallback + callback task]
    WD[Audio-level watchdog] -->|monitors bridged audio| WT
    WD -->|dead air detected| Off[Auto-disable warm transfer + report]
    RT --> Rec[(Recap + consented recording with retention policy)]
